#### 1. Delinquency and Reactivation Logic (`src/billing.ts`)
In [src/billing.ts](file:///C:/Users/aradhya/Desktop/Ethan%20Personal%20Projects/queryio%20mcp/benchmark/runs/arm_c_task_2_run_1/workspace/src/billing.ts):
- **Grace Period**: 
  ```typescript
  const GRACE_DAYS = 14;
  ```
- **Delinquency Check (`isDelinquent`)**:
  ```typescript
  export async function isDelinquent(orgId: number): Promise<boolean> {
    const row = await db.maybeOne(sql`
      SELECT 1 FROM invoices
      WHERE org_id = ${orgId}
        AND status = 'open'
        AND due_at < now() - ${GRACE_DAYS} * interval '1 day'
      LIMIT 1`);
    return row !== null;
  }
  ```
